      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">a battery separator</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was obtained in the same manner as in Example 1 except that twenty-five parts by mass of the mixture obtained was loaded into a strong-blending twin-screw extruder (feed rate Q of the polyethylene composition: 54 kg/h); 75 parts by mass of liquid paraffin was fed to the twin-screw extruder via a side feeder and melt-blended at a temperature of 210° C. while keeping the screw speed Ns at 720 rpm (Q/Ns: 0.075 kg/h/rpm) to prepare a polyethylene solution; a gel-like sheet was stretched at 114° C.; and the heat-setting temperature was 120° C.</span>
